---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="Privacy">
  <article class="reading shell">
    <h1>Privacy</h1><section>
      <h2>The userscript</h2><p>
        Tempo Control stores preferences and saved timelines in your browser’s
        local storage on SoundCloud. It does not send listening history or those
        settings to a project server.
      </p><p>
        Installation downloads the revision-pinned Signalsmith library from
        jsDelivr through your userscript manager. Buffered playback loads the
        checksum-pinned Mediabunny decoder from jsDelivr when needed and reads
        audio directly from SoundCloud. Your manager also contacts the published
        update address when checking for updates. SoundCloud’s own service and
        privacy practices still apply.
      </p>
    </section><section>
      <h2>Shared links</h2><p>
        A tempo link contains the track path, duration, tempo points, fades and
        pitch mode in its URL fragment. Anyone you send the link to can read
        those settings. Fragments are normally not sent in the initial HTTP
        request, but page scripts and anyone with the link can access them.
      </p>
    </section><section>
      <h2>This website</h2><p>
        This site includes no analytics, advertising scripts or payment embeds.
        Fonts and screenshots are served with the site. A hosting provider may
        keep normal access logs.
      </p><p>
        The synth sample and audio files play locally. Chosen files are not
        uploaded. Loading a SoundCloud link sends that link to this site's
        backend and SoundCloud. The backend temporarily caches track details and
        stream links for one minute. Audio streams directly from SoundCloud to
        your browser. It is not stored by this site. Copy link writes to the
        clipboard when pressed.
      </p>
    </section><section>
      <h2>Optional support</h2><p>
        When enabled, the support button opens PayPal. Payment details are
        handled there, not by this website.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Page>
